  "description": "Test build of Tahm Kench as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Tahm Kench so An Acquired Taste stacks on each champion, Thick Skin stores a share of the real damage as grey health (healed back out of combat, a shield when he is surrounded or low), Devour saves an ally who is low, losing health fast or held among enemies (else eats a champion with three stacks) and carries him away, and Abyssal Dive goes in only with allies beside him. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
